WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.630
- Okay, bad legal take alert,

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.360
this time from famed director,
Rob Reiner who writes,

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.767
"Fox News' is spreading of disinformation

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.247
"and lies about vaccines
are causing people to die.

00:00:09.247 --> 00:00:11.397
"Legal experts must find
someone with standing

00:00:11.397 --> 00:00:12.890
"to file a lawsuit."

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.460
Well, a couple issues here.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.540
Yeah, standing would
probably be an issue here,

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.060
but the bigger problem
is that there's no claim

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:20.893
that you can make.

00:00:20.893 --> 00:00:22.730
You can find someone with standing,

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.630
but you're not gonna be able
to make a claim against them

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:28.060
because of that thing
called the First Amendment.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.280
You might disagree with the
things that people are saying,

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.330
but under the First Amendment,
you're allowed to lie

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.510
as long as you're not defaming
an individual specifically.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.080
And a lot of these
things are gonna go down

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.840
as just their opinions

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.620
so you might disagree
with someone's opinion.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.860
But again, that's why the
First Amendment exists

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.690
so that we have a marketplace of ideas.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.950
So sorry, Rob,

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.953
your movies are great, but
your legal takes are not.

